# This file (local .env) is ONLY for per-project overrides — NOT for API keys.
# Inference keys live in the REPO-ROOT compute.env (one level up): set NEBIUS_API_KEY there
# (open models, default). See ../COMPUTE.md.

# The paper's default model, openai/gpt-4o-mini, is CLOSED: to run it, also set OPENROUTER_API_KEY
# in the repo-root compute.env. Otherwise pass an open model id Nebius serves (e.g.
# Qwen/Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct) via `--model` on `python -m util.run`, or set it in a config.
# Change `openrouter.model` in a config to any model id, e.g.
#   openai/gpt-4.1-mini · google/gemini-2.5-flash · qwen/qwen3-14b · moonshotai/kimi-k2
# The model must support tool calling (Terrarium agents act through tools).

# CoLLAB is vendored under external/CoLLAB and found automatically; set this only if you moved it.
# TERRARIUM_COLLAB_PATH=external/CoLLAB
